hwm_locationdescription:
HWM-1; tag nailed into large live oak tree in front yard. 
 HWM-2 located on 4th brick from cement;
at 5069 Donald Phillips Rd

hwm_notes:
Talked to landowner; landowner noted that mark was due to rainfall and drain near trailer was clogged. Grass clean; no
other trailers around with mark. HWM below grade of road,opposite side of creek. Landowner showed where water got to;
came within 40 ft of houses.

